        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "\r\n<button class=\"btn btn-default\" onclick=\"window.print();\">Print</button><br>\r\n    \r\n        \r\n            \r\n                <div style=\"padding-left: 50px;\">\r\n                    <em> Eyelets and scallops make this feminine hem special<br>Follow variation 2 from the video (03:37)</em><br>\r\n                </div><br>\r\n                <ol>\r\n                    <li><a data-GlossaryId=\"265\" class=\"glossaryhelp\">Scrap On <i class=\"fa fa-question-circle course\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a> 40-60 stitches</li>\r\n                    <li>Knit a few rows of scrap</li>\r\n                    <li>Knit 1 row of ravel cord</li>\r\n                    <hr>\r\n                    <li>Remove Scrap yarn and switch to main yarn</li>\r\n                    <li>Using 2 strands of yarn e-Wrap every needle</li>\r\n                    <li> Knit 1 row</li>\r\n                    <li>Transfer every other needle to create eyelets</li>\r\n                    <hr>\r\n                    <li>Knit 1 row</li>\r\n                    <li>Hold every 8th needle</li>\r\n                    <li> Carefully knit 6-8 rows in tuck</li>\r\n                    <em>Check the stitch formation</em>\r\n                    <hr>\r\n                    <li>Pull all needles out</li>\r\n                    <li>Cancel hold and knit 1 row</li>\r\n                    <li> Pull needles out again</li>\r\n                    <li> Continue knitting 20-30 rows</li>\r\n                    <li> Bind off or drop the work from the machine</li>\r\n                    <li>Mark the swatch and examine the hem</li>\r\n                </ol>\r\n\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"no-print\">\r\n                <div class=\"subvideopopup\" data-videotitle=\"Scalloped Eyelet Hem\" data-vimeoid=\"151859900\">\r\n                    <img class=\"img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/551703837-ca24c50faabddc69ef49483d3a5fb474294f163b0d6dd411cece10dee28f9185-d_1280x720?r=pad\">\r\n                    <div class=\"imagecenter text-center\"><button class=\"btn btn-sm\"><i class=\"fa fa-youtube-play fa-2x learn\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></div>\r\n                    <figcaption align=\"center\">\r\n                        <span class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-3 fa-xl course\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"></span>\r\n                        Scalloped Eyelet Hem\r\n                    </figcaption>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        \r\n    \r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 9743,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
