        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "\r\n\r\nPlain or Fancy, hems can add the perfect touch to any knitting project.<br>If you are knitting a sweater, a simple cast on edge may be the casual look you want.  Traditional ribbed hems and cuffs have their place ... but you can do so much more! <br>No matter what your pattern says, take charge and plan for hems for your next project!<br><div class=\"text-center\"></div>\r\n\r\n\t<img class=\"img-thumbnail\" src=\"/path/images/82/hems_thumb.jpg\">\r\n\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 9745,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
